{"ID":"20240513083405-g4qks0m","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083405-g4qks0m","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083405-g4qks0m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105858-szehctu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105904-2jypujm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105858-szehctu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:222,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:239\u0026#125;","title":"050","type":"doc","updated":"20240514101205"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513105858-szehctu","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 904px;","id":"20240513105858-szehctu","updated":"20240514101205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期：04/25/2008"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"050-2 H, YT"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"46歲，瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"04/28/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因︰"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺癌。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診\n睡眠︰"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每天凌晨三點至四點鐘醒來，是在心痛症狀之後出現的。(所以心臟先出現問題，然後再影響肺)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"體力︰"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口︰"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"還可以。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨晚一直咳嗽 (師言前方中的桔梗與甘草清肺痰，所以病患的咳嗽會增加，可配合多活動，對肺臟好。)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同前穴，加中脘("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"增進胃口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")、俠溪、魚際("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"魚際為滎穴治療時症,她每晚三點醒來"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同 4/ 25 方加:枳實三錢 薤白三錢 瓜蔞實五錢三付 九碗煮三碗 早晚飯前"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.若服藥後頭髮變烏亮了,代表肺金生腎水了,是病癒佳兆。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240513105904-2jypujm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513105904-2jypujm"}}]}